.0,"t":"Multiple colors is a luxury.","x":"Used the shower cap, obviously, in the shower. FOR the smallness of the cap, it fits nice and closely to your head.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-8","r":1.0,"t":"Too small for my head","x":"I don't have long hair, but the cap was just too small to cover my head","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-9","r":1.0,"t":"Not for Long Hair","x":"they were too small to accommodate my hair. Poor description.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-10","r":5.0,"t":"useful","x":"really good and useful\uff0c my gf like it so much\u3002","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-11","r":1.0,"t":"sized incorrectly and hair was wet.","x":"Unusable, very very small and hair was wet.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-12","r":5.0,"t":"Nice quality","x":"I just received the pack of four and they look very nice and sturdy. I haven't tried them in the shower yet, but I don't see any reason for them not to work as they should, they have an outer and an inner layer, so that should award protection enough. I did try them on, however, the elastic fits nicely and is not constrictive.  The only negative comment is that they are a tad smallish, but for my base-of-neck long hair, very fine and straight, they provide sufficient cover. I much rather have th","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-13","r":3.0,"t":"Love everything about them except the size....","x":"Love everything about them except they're too small :-( What a bummer! They fit my four year old perfectly...he has a slightly large head I would say. But I don't see how they would work for an adult woman, with any hair under there. I dismissed the reviews saying they were too small b/c I do not have thick hair, and I thought that must be the problem. But nope. They are significantly smaller than my old shower cap I was replacing. I love the colors, the clear plastic on one side....so disappoin","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-14","r":4.0,"t":"The price.","x":"I like it very much. I is waterproof and does a real good job of keeping my hair dry when I take a shower. It could be a little bigger in size, but that is the only thing I don't like and it is just a miner thing. I had tried to find some in our local store and hadn't found any and these were a very attractive price. I also got them very quickly.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-15","r":4.0,"t":"Very Small","x":"Nice cap. Satin on outside and vinyl on the inside. Could be used as a sleep cap, as well as, a shower cap; however, too small to use over long hair, rollers, or a hair style that you\u2019re trying to protect from water or sleep with. Would like still wet the satin when the vinyl was turned to the outside.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-16","r":5.0,"t":"An Super Shower Cap","x":"This is the best shower cap I've ever worn.It's big enough to cover my head.This stretch doesn't hurt my hair, it's better than any shower cap I've ever used.I wash my face with it and it keeps these products from getting into my hair.I highly recommend this shower cap","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-17","r":1.0,"t":"Too small","x":"Very disappointed!! These look really cute with different prints but they\u2019re definitely not made for adults. I even tried it on my 9-year-old and it didn\u2019t cover anything. Very cheaply made. May fit a very small head without any hair. Would not recommend this.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-18","r":5.0,"t":"Satin and lace","x":"I hadn't used a shower bonnet in years and was pleasantly surprised at the look of them now ! The satiny material with the lace trim are so cute and I love them. And WOW there's 4. Three solid colors and one attractively designed.  A wise buy--!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-19","r":4.0,"t":"This is made a little on the small","x":"I'm small with shoulder length hair but if my hair was much longer or thicker, I don't think this would work well because the cap is not generous on fabric.  Otherwise, the thickness is really good and fabric quality is good.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-20","r":3.0,"t":"too small","x":"it is good quality,but it is really small,I am a small person,it is still small for me.not big enough and not deep enough,I hope factory will make it bigger in the future.if you have a daughter,it would be better for them.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-21","r":5.0,"t":"Thick","x":"Very thick and good quality!  Water resistant and my hair does not get wet.  They are not super large so you can\u2019t wear them with probably really big hair .  However I have shoulder length and It works well for me","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-22","r":5.0,"t":"A bit small for me but still 5 stars for quality and looks","x":"I like it a lot. The only downside is it doesn\u2019t fit my head. I have a big head and fro and even when my fro is laid the edges are still exposed and gets wet. I may have to use 2 caps","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-23","r":3.0,"t":"Not big enough when hair is putted in a bun","x":"Kept coming off my head it stretch out but doesn't stay put so it moves and my hair would get wet at bottom wish it was bigger and my head not that big other then that it's great","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B0837NJT25-24","r":5.0,"t":"THE most Comfortable","x":"Best shower caps I have ever used, and I use them daily. The silkiness is  unreal and the band fits any size head perfectly, might I add they are beautiful!! Amazing buy!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the caps too small, especially for adults or people with long or thick hair.","cites":[1,2,7,9,10,12,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers say the caps are not deep enough to hold long hair or a bun.","cites":[3,6,7,10]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the caps keep hair dry and are waterproof.","cites":[5,6,12,15]},{"text":"Reviewers describe the caps as snug-fitting and comfortable.","cites":[5,6,8,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers praise the quality, durability, and style of the caps.","cites":[4,13,15]}]},"qa":[]}